hidden_read_delegated_rule.cardlang:38:17: error: rule `NoHeartsFromAStrongHand`'s `applies_when:` is decided by `chooser_for(actor)`, so `chooser_for(actor)` must be able to check it, but it reads the cards in `hand[actor]`, which `chooser_for(actor)` cannot see (under Delegated Play `actor` is the seat whose card is played, and `chooser_for(actor)` chooses it; the bare `hand` reads the pool the chooser plays from). Read the deciding seat's own cards, or have the holder announce or reveal the fact first
